The '''YG-series''' was a line of [[transport]]s manufactured by [[Corellian Engineering Corporation]]. When developing the [[YT-1000 light freighter]] of the [[YT-series]], CEC saw it as an experimental departure from the YG series.<ref name="Manual" /> During the [[High Republic Era]], a model of YG freighter called the YG-2500 was used.<ref name="TFS">''[[The High Republic: The Fallen Star]]''</ref>

